<title>POLAND: Elektrobudowa sees 97 net at PLN 17.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektrobudowa sees 97 net at PLN 17.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Elektrobudowa SA sees its net profit rising to 17.3 million zlotys in 1997 up from earlier predicted 13.3-million-zloty net this year, the firm said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa said its 1997 sales were likely to rise to 268.7 million zlotys from 214.6 million expected this year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
